raph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/3dfc1ce6199ff1fa28864a48e3d112f7.poster.avif?t=1786561233\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/3dfc1ce6199ff1fa28864a48e3d112f7.webm?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/3dfc1ce6199ff1fa28864a48e3d112f7.mp4?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/b00fbb1175f117e7b3151d40bc2266bf.poster.avif?t=1786561233\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/b00fbb1175f117e7b3151d40bc2266bf.webm?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/b00fbb1175f117e7b3151d40bc2266bf.mp4?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Together 'Til The End?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each NPC is in tune with their surroundings and knows more about the map and yourself than you may expect. Chat with them and build a connection as you explore their captivating homes. Learn more about their unique stories and see if you want to split or commit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/863ba02e4f5fa0b54dfe7cec8d6d39c0.poster.avif?t=1786561233\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/863ba02e4f5fa0b54dfe7cec8d6d39c0.webm?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/863ba02e4f5fa0b54dfe7cec8d6d39c0.mp4?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unscripted AI Dialogue:</strong> Powered by advanced LLM technology, every NPC possesses a distinct, dynamic personality. They will fixate on the tasks at hand or lean into your prompted chaos in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flirt with Fate:</strong> Charm them, betray them, or outsmart them. Endless chat styles unlock a massive gallery of diverse endings across every chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couple Moments:</strong> It's not all life-or-death! Vibe with the girls as they surprise you with a dance, bond over a meal, interpret your artwork, or judge your puzzle-solving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos to Calm:</strong> Retreat from the high-stakes drama of the maps to spend time with your favorite companion in a safe haven. Build your relationship without the life-or-death scenarios of their homeworlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/aa7e8e11b2cf88d85565452331ca68a3.poster.avif?t=1786561233\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/aa7e8e11b2cf88d85565452331ca68a3.webm?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/aa7e8e11b2cf88d85565452331ca68a3.mp4?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/a23323c17e4335dd1530a6bfeb6fc125.poster.avif?t=1786561233\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/a23323c17e4335dd1530a6bfeb6fc125.webm?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/a23323c17e4335dd1530a6bfeb6fc125.mp4?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/6f6e0c00819a7561e98d4026af472b98.poster.avif?t=1786561233\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/6f6e0c00819a7561e98d4026af472b98.webm?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/6f6e0c00819a7561e98d4026af472b98.mp4?t=1786561233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This AI-native game includes romantic themes and mild fantasy violence (presented as stylized “crimes of passion”), but it does not feature mature or explicit content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because conversations evolve based on player input, tone and topics may vary. The game includes built-in filters and safety measures to help keep dialogue appropriate and comfortable for most players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI systems in AI2U are designed to enhance storytelling, not to collect or learn from personal data. Player conversations are processed safely and privately within the game experience. We encourage curiosity, creativity, and kindness in every interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras/5175a1a9b04b524c3a2fdbd1f0e3b550.avif?t=1786561233\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/extras_big/5175a1a9b04b524c3a2fdbd1f0e3b550.webp?t=1786561233 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Kidnapped by a cute yandere catgirl, your only way out is to persuade her to let you leave! Engage with thematic stories, solve puzzles, and interact with best yandere AI NPCs in this top-rated AI game loved by millions of fans. Bask in sweet meet-cutes, or brace for chaos if you dare to escape! :3", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/b686a0860911e2c79174e42d3eb27965418ae8a8/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1786561233", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/f1b15c48335754069bed89ef8091dff6459a6517/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786561233", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880730/f1b15c48335754069bed89ef8091dff6459a6517/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786561233", "website": "https://www.alterstaff.io/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD equivalent<